[cell][color=yellow]Mouse[/color][/cell][cell]Aim / Look[/cell]
[cell][color=yellow]Left Click[/color][/cell][cell]Shoot[/cell]
[cell][color=yellow]Shift[/color][/cell][cell]Sprint[/cell]
[cell][color=yellow]Space[/color][/cell][cell]Jump[/cell]
[cell][color=yellow]Ctrl[/color][/cell][cell]Crouch[/cell]
[cell][color=yellow]R[/color][/cell][cell]Reload[/cell]
[cell][color=yellow]V[/color][/cell][cell]Toggle 1st/3rd person[/cell]
[cell][color=yellow]1-5[/color][/cell][cell]Select weapon[/cell]
[cell][color=yellow]Scroll[/color][/cell][cell]Cycle weapons[/cell]
[cell][color=yellow]T[/color][/cell][cell]Open chat[/cell]
[cell][color=yellow]Enter[/color][/cell][cell]Send message / Close chat[/cell]
[cell][color=yellow]Esc[/color][/cell][cell]Close chat / Release cursor[/cell]
[cell][color=yellow]?[/color][/cell][cell]Toggle this help[/cell]
[/table]"

